  CHEM204:{name:"General Chemistry: Change and Equilibrium", term:"Fall, Winter, Summer", units:3, prereq:"(MATH 30-1 or MATH 212) and (CHEM 30-1 or CHEM 212)", antireq:"CHEM 204, CHEM 203, CHEM 209, CHEM 213 or CHEM 301", description:"An introduction to university chemistry that focuses on an exploration of the fundamental links between kinetics, equilibria and thermodynamics and explores acidity/basicity and redox behaviour using inorganic and organic examples. "},
