  <span class="mark">Geoscience B.Sc — U Calgary</span>
  <h1>Degree plan <em>built with Degree Log</em></h1>
  <p class="note">Planning tool output only. Confirm requirements with an academic advisor and the Academic Calendar for the year you were admitted.</p>
  <div class="grid">${cells}</div>
